aising funds to have large prize pools that players can earn by playing our game at tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rollback Netcode:</strong> Built with Rollback Netcode, supporting the cutting edge of a fluid online experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Familiar Movement:</strong> If you've played other fast moving platform fighters, you'll feel right at home here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697620/extras/48943fd24906040546fe357d4a191e98.poster.avif?t=1770262126\" width=628 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697620/extras/48943fd24906040546fe357d4a191e98.webm?t=1770262126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697620/extras/48943fd24906040546fe357d4a191e98.mp4?t=1770262126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Punkzilla"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697620/header.jpg?t=1770262126","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All Rights Reserved Punkzilla \u00a9 2026","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2697620/437374221/a65afe546fcc7daacf5a994be79d24db337de01c/1755230849/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755242176","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2697620/437374221/a65afe546fcc7daacf5a994be79d24db337de01c/1755230849/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755242176","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2697620/437374221/a65afe546fcc7daacf5